{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12684","headline":"招陶别驾家阳华作 · 元结","name":"招陶别驾家阳华作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海内厌兵革，骚骚十二年。\n阳华洞中人，似不知乱焉。\n谁能家此地，终老可自全。\n草堂背岩洞，几峰轩户前。\n清渠匝庭堂，出门仍灌田。\n半崖盘石径，高亭临极巅。\n引望见何处，迤逶陇北川。\n杉松几万株，苍苍满前山。\n岩高瞹华阳，飞溜何潺潺。\n洞深迷远近，但觉多洄渊。\n昼游兴未尽，日暮不欲眠。\n探烛饮洞中，醉昏漱寒泉。\n始知天下心，耽爱各有偏。\n陶家世高逸，公忍不独然。\n无或毕婚嫁，竟爲俗务牵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12684.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12684","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}